## Core Config Files
- Next: [next.config.mjs](mdc:next.config.mjs)
- TypeScript: [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json)
- Tailwind: [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts)
- PostCSS: [postcss.config.mjs](mdc:postcss.config.mjs)
- App settings docs: [docs/CONFIGURATION.md](mdc:docs/CONFIGURATION.md)
- Public app config: `public/config/*.json` (e.g., [public/config/default.json](mdc:public/config/default.json))

## Models and Providers
- Default models list: `lib/config/default-models.json`
- Model helpers and selection: `lib/config/models.ts`
- Ollama client configuration: `lib/ollama/*` and `app/api/ollama/*`

## Environment Variables
- Place secrets in `.env.local`.
- Typical variables include credentials for Supabase/Redis/Ollama if applicable; see usages across `lib/supabase/*`, `lib/redis/*`, and `lib/ollama/*`.

## Deployment Notes
- Ensure public config JSON is present in `public/config/` for client-side consumption when required.

